    "attributes": {
        "action": "Let 17 Year Olds be able to ride a 300cc motorbike",
        "additional_details": "The proposal could require appropriate training and testing, meaning riders would still have to demonstrate they can ride safely before using a 300cc bike.\r\n    A 300cc motorcycle can provide better acceleration and cruising ability, which can be useful when joining faster-moving traffic.",
        "background": "We believe 17-year-olds should be allowed to ride motorbikes up to 300cc, with proper training and licensing. A higher engine limit would give young riders more practical options while ensuring safety through training, testing, and responsible riding.",
